description:
Screaming Suicide - Metallica 

What better song to cover on the Kirk Hammett ESP LTD KH-202 than this one off the new Metallica album! Here's my cover of the intro to Screaming Suicide with a little guitar solo to finish off! 

What's your favourite song from the new Metallica album? 

